Origin of these files
=====================

code/ and tasks/ are copied unchanged from cmstestsuite/code and
cmstestsuite/tasks of CMS (https://github.com/cms-dev/cms, commit
1914a5aa07fd9c551b8ec31400e5776e5f9bfa9f, 2026-10-05), licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License version 3 or later like the rest of CMS
and of this project. Copyright the CMS authors (see the AUTHORS file of
CMS).

Only the data and the managers of each task were copied (tasks/*/data,
tasks/*/code); the task definitions (tasks/*/__init__.py) are written in
Go in sandbox_test.go, with the same parameters, and the test list
(cmstestsuite/Tests.py) is ported there too. The task batch_50 was not
copied.

extra/ holds programs written for this project (not from CMS): solutions
in Go and Kotlin, which CMS does not support, and cases for behaviours of
this fork (the seccomp filter, Communication tasks whose user process
dies early).
